# packages/data/generated/ IS COMMITTED. DECISIONS #6: "PokeAPI is snapshotted at build
# time into committed JSON. Never fetched at runtime." This file previously carried
# `packages/data/generated/*.json`, which excluded the seven snapshot files that decision
# exists to guarantee - a fresh clone would have had generated/index.ts importing JSON
# that was not in the repo. Asserted by tools/seams/snapshot-committed.test.ts.
#
# What IS ignored is the raw HTTP cache the snapshot script writes: ~36 MB of PokeAPI
# responses, reproducible from the network, and pure churn in a diff.
